    <description>This flow facilitates the submission of CMN Requests for approval. It updates the request status to &quot;Pending Approval&quot; and initiates the approval process. The flow is triggered when the user clicks the &quot;Submit for Approval&quot; button on eligible request statuses (Pending Approval, Resubmitted, Pending Remediation, and Returned). A confirmation screen is presented to ensure the user reviews the request details before proceeding.</description>
